emmylua-ls: Import emmylua-ls 0.25.1 as devel/emmylua-ls.

emmylua-ls is a Lua language server with fast, incremental analysis
that supports Lua 5.1 to 5.5 including LuaJIT. Supports both EmmyLua
and LuaCATS annotations. Includes a static analyzer(emmylua_check) and
a documentation generator(emmylua_doc_cli).
